{"specCanvas":{"width":1320,"height":1080,"boundingBox":[0,36,44,0],"background":"paper","keepAspectRatio":true},"display":{"purpose":"instructional","layout":"scroll","minTextPx":16,"widths":[640]},"layout":{"minLabelGap":4},"otherTopLevel":{"schema":"ld-s10y-image/figure-spec@2","id":"fig-25","mode":"deterministic","description":"Four separate ruled coordinate frames for exercise 136. Preserve the source hatching, solid boundaries, given scale labels, bounded rectangle above the x axis, right semicircular region, and concentric annulus. Do not print an answer or additional coordinate/radius annotations."}}
{"inventory":{"id":"fig-25-a","description":"upper left: source label а); 18 columns, 9 rows, unit grid phase through O; Only the lower-right side of O is hatched. The displayed hatching occupies ten columns to the right and four rows below the axes, reaching the right and bottom frame edges. All defining boundaries are solid. Original axis/tick labels are retained. No source point dots are present. Modern English label a) and regularized placement are additions, not source labels.","requires":["gridDimensions"],"objectCount":39,"assertionCount":118}}
{"inventory":{"id":"fig-25-b","description":"upper right: source label б); 18 columns, 9 rows, unit grid phase through O; A bounded rectangle two grid columns wide and three grid rows high, wholly to the right of the y axis and above the x axis. Its bottom is one unit above O. Hatching does not extend to either coordinate axis or to the frame. All defining boundaries are solid. Original axis/tick labels are retained. No source point dots are present. Modern English label b) and regularized placement are additions, not source labels.","requires":["gridDimensions"],"objectCount":26,"assertionCount":57}}
{"inventory":{"id":"fig-25-v","description":"lower left: source label в); 18 columns, 15 rows, unit grid phase through O; The interior of the right semicircle is hatched both above and below the horizontal axis. The left semicircle interior retains grid only; the area outside the full circle is also unhatched. All defining boundaries are solid. Original axis/tick labels are retained. No source point dots are present. Modern English label c) and regularized placement are additions, not source labels.","requires":["gridDimensions"],"objectCount":28,"assertionCount":89}}
{"inventory":{"id":"fig-25-g","description":"lower right: source label г); 18 columns, 15 rows, unit grid phase through O; The full annular region between the two concentric circles is hatched around all sides of O. The entire central disk and all grid outside the outer circle are unhatched. All defining boundaries are solid. Original axis/tick labels are retained. No source point dots are present. Modern English label d) and regularized placement are additions, not source labels.","requires":["gridDimensions"],"objectCount":66,"assertionCount":232}}
